  "help.keys": "In the game the number keys choose a zone: 1 forest, 2 grassland, 3 wetland, which also moves the view. 4 birdfeeder, 5 tray, 6 supply, 7 hand, 8 status, 9 players, 0 round goals. In a zone Left and Right choose, Home and End jump to the start and the end, Up and Down read the details line by line, Escape goes back to the game. Enter selects, Space continues or confirms, Escape goes back. Outside zones the arrow keys move through menus and the game's choices. Tab and Shift+Tab: next and previous card. Page Up and Page Down: previous and next message, with Control the first and the latest. X: context action, for example trade or reroll. G: goal board. O: overview of the habitats. F10: pause menu. F1: this help. F2: read the screen. F3: description of the selected element. F11: status.",
